{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2022-08-30 07:30:00', 'title': 'LARGE-SCALE GREEN HYDROGEN FOR THE UK: AIR PRODUCTS AND ASSOCIATED BRITISH PORTS PARTNER ON RENEWABLE HYDROGEN PRODUCTION', 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. AND LONDON , AUG. 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE: APD) AND ASSOCIATED BRITISH PORTS (ABP) ANNOUNCED TODAY THEIR INTENTION TO PARTNER IN BRINGING THE FIRST LARGE SCALE, GREEN HYDROGEN PRODUCTION FACILITY TO THE UK.'}